# LF everywhere, in the repo AND in working trees (overrides core.autocrlf=true on
# Windows), so formatters and git agree and checkouts don't create whitespace diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch line endings or diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.docx binary
